      "question": "What are things first time home buyers should know?",
      "answer": "First-time buyers should establish a budget and review their credit before shopping. Securing a mortgage pre-approval comes before making an offer. Include contract contingencies in your purchase offer. Read our complete [first-time home buyer guide](/guides/first-time-home-buyer-guide/) for detailed step-by-step guidance."
    },
