    {
      "question": "Do I need flood insurance?",
      "answer": "Flood insurance is required by lenders on most mortgages when the home sits in a high-risk flood hazard area. Standard homeowners policies generally do not cover flood damage. You can look up any property address on the official [FEMA Flood Map Service Center](https://msc.fema.gov/portal/home) to identify its flood zone."
    },
    {
      "question": "What changes on the checklist if I pay cash?",
      "answer": "Paying cash removes the mortgage pre-approval milestone from your task list entirely. Property inspections and final walkthrough checks remain on your list."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can I save this checklist as a PDF?",
      "answer": "Yes, you can generate a clean PDF directly from this page without signing up. Click the Print or save as PDF button located near the bottom of the tool. When your browser print dialog opens, set the printer destination to Save as PDF and save the worksheet to your device."
